      "ActivityInternational": false,
      "ActivityInternationalDescription": "We help build technical and human capabilities across the Asia Pacific, ensuring that everyone can use and benefit from expanded infrastructure, enhanced access, and increased human capacity to support and benefit from digital technologies. Our initiatives focus on empowering individuals and communities to participate fully in the digital economy and society.  We champion the development and deployment of digital innovation, new and emerging technologies that are designed with and for diverse communities, ensuring no one is left behind. Our approach to innovation is rooted in equity, leveraging new technologies to bridge divides and create solutions that are accessible, affordable, relevant, and help to better lives.  We foster environments where emerging ideas can be piloted, replicated, scaled, and shared, thus amplifying impact across the region and beyond.  Our programs bridge the gap between technology and policy, and help further socio-economic progress in the region.",
