      "ActivityPersuitPurposesDescription": "In 2025, we invested USD 10 million (AUD ~15 million) across our three strategic pillars: Building Capabilities, Driving Digital Innovation, and Supporting Digital Transformation. Together with our partners, we reached communities and practitioners across 30 economies in the Asia Pacific region, delivered capability-building initiatives for 11,533 people, contributed to digital inclusion efforts that directly benefited more than 196,700 individuals and supported digital transformation across 3 economies.",
